@startuml
!include _style.iuml
' Adapted from reviewed presentation sources: W3-04, W3-07a, W3-09a/b/c, W3-17/23; W1-dispatch/probe-redirect
skinparam dpi 110
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam ArrowFontSize 17
skinparam ClassAttributeFontSize 17
skinparam ClassStereotypeFontSize 15
skinparam NoteFontSize 16
skinparam LegendFontSize 15
skinparam titleFontSize 20
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam maxMessageSize 165
skinparam nodesep 18
skinparam ranksep 24
hide footbox
hide circle
title UC-2 · refusal, redirect and execution failure
autonumber
participant "worker.sqs" as W $PROC
participant "messaging" as M $PROC
participant "recovery" as R $PROC
[-> W : execute_message(...)
alt claim yields no authority
 W -> M : work_disposition(factory, job_id, attempt_id)
 M --> W : stale or other durable disposition
 W -->[ : drain only proved-stale; otherwise retain
else check_probe raises NotAdmitted
 W -> M : redirect_to_long_lane(factory, work)
 M -> M : SQL: current pair + DB-clock live fence
 alt current live lease
  M -> M : SQL: abandon old; cleanup; new Attempt;\nemit_state; COMMIT
  M --> W : True; standard work retained
 else stale lease
  M --> W : False; no mutation
 end
else ordinary pipeline error, live authority
 W -> M : finish(factory, work, error=curated_error)
 M --> W : True after failed state + result intent
else LeaseLost / AttemptDeadline / cancellation
 W -->[ : False; no finish; receipt retained
 ... separate repair invocation ...
 [-> R : recover_expired(factory, on_change=emit_state)
 R -> R : SQL: current pair + DB-clock expiry recheck
 R -> R : interrupt(session, job, attempt, now,\nmessage, on_change)
 R -->[ : abandoned Attempt; failed Job;\ncleanup + result committed
end
note over W,R
Ordinary optional-HLS error keeps primary output.
Queued-work repair keeps the same Attempt UUID.
Expired execution waits for owner retry (UC-4).
end note
@enduml
